    "title": "Powder and Ekko watching fireworks [Arcane] [Jinx] [Ekko]",
    "description": "Click on Powder's head to play a song! Sit back, relax and enjoy fireworks alongside Powder and Ekko on a beautiful night. Any media you play, it's name will show up on the wire but you will need to pause the wallpaper song first.\r\n\r\nThe fireworks launch positions randomize every time you switch to this wallpaper so it feels new every time.\r\n\r\nMake sure to use the Fireworks count slider to adjust the amount of fireworks to your taste. Also there is an audio visualizer. You will need to check the sound recording in options for it to show. Or turn off recording to hide it.\r\n\r\nSet position to 65 if you are on a 16:9 screen.\r\n\r\nI also made similar wallpaper of just powder watching fireworks - https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3374358425\r\n\r\nAlso big thanks to @Arcane4K on twitter for the upscaled image.\r\n\r\nFeel free to leave suggestions in the comments.",
