    "isSimulated": false,
    "title": "Aperture Science Facility Management Terminal",
    "description": "Welcome to the Aperture Science Computer Aided Enrichment Center\r\n\r\nStep into the shoes of a facility operator with this immersive Portal themed wallpaper that brings the Aperture Science facility management system to life on your desktop.\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n\r\n- Authentic Portal Experience: Complete with Aperture Science branding, boot sequences, and facility management interface\r\n\r\n- Live System Monitoring: Real-time status updates for power systems, life support, security, portal technology, and more\r\n\r\n- Test Chamber Grid: Dynamic chamber status display with live updates\r\n\r\n- Audio Reactive: Bass and treble frequencies from your music pulse the interface and chambers\r\n\r\n- Customizable Identity: Set your own username, clearance level (1-9), and assigned sector\r\n\r\n- Multiple Layout Modes: Full workstation interface or minimal console mode\r\n\r\n- Retro CRT Effects: Optional scanlines and glow effects for that authentic 80s computer feel\r\n\r\n- Highly Customizable: Adjust colors, timing, visual effects, and information display\r\n\r\nPerfect For:\r\n\r\n- Portal fans who want to feel like they're working at Aperture Science\r\n\r\n- Retro computing enthusiasts who appreciate authentic terminal aesthetics\r\n\r\n- Anyone who wants a unique, interactive desktop experience that responds to their music\r\n\r\nWarning: This wallpaper may cause an uncontrollable urge to conduct unethical science experiments. Not responsible for cake consumption or companion cube attachment.\r\n\r\nNow with working neurotoxin vent status and emergency protocol monitoring!",
